<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kent Electronics lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kent Electronics lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney lowered its recommendation on Kent Electronics Corp to neutral from buy, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- Shares remained untraded on the New York Stock Exchange early Friday because of a trading imbalance and were indicated to open between 17 and 20, below yesterday's 21-3/8 close, the NYSE said.</p>
</text>
